      "text": "Choose labels and a simple baseline.\nTrain on past tickets and inspect mistakes.\nDeliver a versioned model and evaluation report.",
      "originalText": "Choose labels and a simple baseline.\nTrain on past tickets and inspect mistakes.\nDeliver a versioned model and evaluation report.",
