      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Send a ticket. Look for HTTP 200, its predicted queue and the expected model version. The response below is an example.",
      "originalText": "Send a ticket. Look for HTTP 200, its predicted queue and the expected model version. The response below is an example.",
