      "updated": 1795105606552,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Try it  •  A draft promises an immediate refund, but its source only describes a review. What should happen?",
      "originalText": "Try it  •  A draft promises an immediate refund, but its source only describes a review. What should happen?",
