      "text": "Split first. Fit vocabulary, imputation and scaling\nonly on training data. Exclude the final queue.",
      "originalText": "Split first. Fit vocabulary, imputation and scaling\nonly on training data. Exclude the final queue.",
      "fontSize": 9.04,
